    "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14099811/assets/ddc6c02aff017b31dd24ba6d47a3527aa46a2a5130cffc7094122545babd7656.png)\n\nConsider the region $R$ shown above. Let the function $f(x,y)$ be defined as\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\{\\begin{aligned}y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x, & (x,y)\\in S, \\\\ 0, & (x,y)\\in T, \\\\ {e}^{x+y}, & (x,y)\\in U.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen,\n\n$$\n{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A=\n$$",
